# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We here construct a circuit for a single time step using Lie–Trotter.\n"
"The Lie product formula (first order) is implemented in the [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter) class. A first-order formula consists of the approximation stated in the introduction, where the matrix exponential of a sum is approximated by a product of matrix exponentials:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagtatayo tayo dito ng circuit para sa isang time step gamit ang Lie–Trotter.\n"
"Ang Lie product formula (first order) ay naipapatupad sa klase na [LieTrotter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.LieTrotter). Ang isang first-order formula ay binubuo ng approximation na nakasaad sa panimula, kung saan ang matrix exponential ng isang kabuuan ay inaproksima ng produkto ng mga matrix exponential:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"
"Let us count the operations for this circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"e^{H_1+H_2} \\approx e^{H_1} e^{H_2}\n"
"$$\n"

